#: ../../source/docs/unit-tests.rst:5 dd93b2b6dd0e49a1b8285e33e6cb966b
msgid "ArduPilot Unit Tests"
msgstr "ArduPilot 单元测试"

#: ../../source/docs/unit-tests.rst:7 c248bacd1c814457a253aa2ac6f51b96
msgid ""
"ArduPilot's Unit Test suite allows for the creation of repeatable tests "
"which help prevent regressions in ArduPilot's internal functions.  It is "
"based on Google's `GTest Framework "
"<https://github.com/google/googletest>`__."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 的单元测试套件支持创建可重复执行的测试，有助于防止 ArduPilot 内部函数出现回归问题。它基于 Google 的 `GTest"
" 框架 <https://github.com/google/googletest>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/unit-tests.rst:11 074956171a664f6599e58bd593640c79
msgid "Using ArduPilot's Unit Tests can:"
msgstr "使用 ArduPilot 单元测试可以："

#: ../../source/docs/unit-tests.rst:13 02ce69969d1342e4a4f3db5957500719
msgid ""
"make your development process more efficient by reducing time spent "
"repeatedly running the same tests to force the same inputs to a function "
"time and again"
msgstr "通过减少反复向函数输入相同数据以重复运行相同测试所花费的时间，提高开发效率"

#: ../../source/docs/unit-tests.rst:14 e71a1eee7fb24d798286571fe99df95d
msgid ""
"allow you to repeatedly replicate bad behaviour in an ArduPilot function, "
"and possibly ship that test to a developer capable of fixing the issue "
"(\"test-driven-development\")"
msgstr "允许反复复现 ArduPilot 函数中的异常行为，并可将测试用例提交给能够修复该问题的开发者（「测试驱动开发」）"

#: ../../source/docs/unit-tests.rst:15 d596102d92434a618a879e376bc192f3
msgid ""
"reduce the chances of a regression in an ArduPilot function's behaviour by "
"locking in tests for that function's behaviour"
msgstr "通过固定对特定函数行为的测试，降低该函数出现行为回归的可能性"

#: ../../source/docs/unit-tests.rst:18 22403a65a8e74e25a092ba95fa3ab0d3
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/unit-tests.rst:20 5ad9826522e142e2a60928724fd9230e
msgid ""
"The Unit test suite is run on ArduPilot's autotest server on most commits to"
" the master branch, but can be run locally to vet software changes.  Adding "
"tests is straight-forward and encouraged to prove a function's correctness "
"after a change."
msgstr ""
"单元测试套件会在大多数 commit 提交到 master 分支时在 ArduPilot "
"自动化测试服务器上运行，也可以在本地运行以验证软件更改。添加测试非常简单，建议在修改后通过测试证明函数的正确性。"

#: ../../source/docs/unit-tests.rst:27 70c8041158ff4e979e6ec250b36fdcd5
msgid "Running Unit Tests"
msgstr "运行单元测试"

#: ../../source/docs/unit-tests.rst:29 e17852fcb5284fd991fd2cb586f93267
msgid ""
"The Unit Tests require an environment in which the ArduPilot executables can"
" be compiled.  The easiest way to obtain this is to create a SITL testing "
"environment.  Use the SITL instructions (:ref:`SITL <using-sitl-for-"
"ardupilot-testing>`) to obtain a valid environment.  It is suggested the "
"ArduPilot Vagrant virtual machine configuration files be used to obtain a "
"working environment."
msgstr ""
"单元测试需要一个能够编译 ArduPilot 可执行文件的环境。最简便的方法是创建一个 SITL 测试环境。请参照 SITL 说明（:ref:`SITL"
" <using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing>`）搭建有效的环境。建议使用 ArduPilot Vagrant "
"虚拟机配置文件来获取可用的工作环境。"

#: ../../source/docs/unit-tests.rst:32 3cc88dab1cfc466fac4af78b7a97ca27
msgid "Invocation"
msgstr "调用方式"

#: ../../source/docs/unit-tests.rst:36 4b357225a6c149078e609076b2da6ab3
msgid ""
"These tests work well under Linux.  Operation under different environments "
"is unknown."
msgstr "这些测试在 Linux 下运行良好。在其他环境下的运行情况未知。"

#: ../../source/docs/unit-tests.rst:38 1c5b597fccc2494095cc7303f26f8388
msgid "The unit tests are compiled using the `waf` build tool:"
msgstr "单元测试使用 `waf` 构建工具进行编译："

#: ../../source/docs/unit-tests.rst:68 c1aae8f6e8d34a4ba244b63024cddd15
msgid "You can then simply run the test from the build directory:"
msgstr "然后可以直接从构建目录运行测试："

#: ../../source/docs/unit-tests.rst:98 f34fd21a0d154bcb856bda611c756cc9
msgid "Using with GDB"
msgstr "与 GDB 结合使用"

#: ../../source/docs/unit-tests.rst:100 53d868d62cf8495db8a84a6c3b790bdc
msgid "The tests can be run under GDB to trace problems:"
msgstr "可以在 GDB 下运行测试以追踪问题："

#: ../../source/docs/unit-tests.rst:131 ea6582ffe5a94998a29ce3f2598c19af
msgid "Using with Valgrind"
msgstr "与 Valgrind 结合使用"

#: ../../source/docs/unit-tests.rst:133 eb4cbaaf810140cab46e5835c7f9b066
msgid ""
"The tests can be run under Valgrind's memcheck too to trace memory problems:"
msgstr "也可以在 Valgrind 的 memcheck 工具下运行测试以追踪内存问题："

#: ../../source/docs/unit-tests.rst:179 db56708928ec483ab3ac5bd14be4165d
msgid "Unit Tests Structure"
msgstr "单元测试结构"

#: ../../source/docs/unit-tests.rst:181 ca88e648bc6e45fe81139eb8d6206e1a
msgid ""
"A directory in the ArduPilot source tree can contain a `wscript` file "
"designating it as containing unit tests."
msgstr "ArduPilot 源代码树中的某个目录可以包含一个 `wscript` 文件，用于标识该目录包含单元测试。"

#: ../../source/docs/unit-tests.rst:183 c0ea2f12a4bd47d6a2f47fb29788c145
msgid ""
"Each .cpp file in that directory is then considered a valid test, and will "
"be included in the tests compiled when `waf` is invoked for the `tests` "
"target."
msgstr "该目录中的每个 .cpp 文件都被视为有效测试，在以 `tests` 为目标调用 `waf` 时将被编译为测试。"

#: ../../source/docs/unit-tests.rst:185 bf29836767dd431ea1f1f6cd9c6620f1
msgid "Tests are present in the following directories at time if writing: ::"
msgstr "撰写本文时，测试位于以下目录中："

#: ../../source/docs/unit-tests.rst:197 920a1625cc5044d1a8184f88d0be9544
msgid "Adding a Unit Test"
msgstr "添加单元测试"

#: ../../source/docs/unit-tests.rst:199 8300992dc0cd4c84be472342293c6da5
msgid ""
"Generally copying an existing file aside and using it as the basis of your "
"new tests is the way forward.  See the GTest framework documentation for "
"more information."
msgstr "通常，复制一个现有文件并以此为基础编写新测试是最佳做法。更多信息请参阅 GTest 框架文档。"
